namespace jxx::awt::image::internal{BufferedImageSource::BufferedImageSource(const ::jxx::Ptr<BufferedImage>&i):image_(i){}void BufferedImageSource::addConsumer(const ::jxx::Ptr<ImageConsumer>&c){if(c&&std::find(consumers_.begin(),consumers_.end(),c)==consumers_.end())consumers_.push_back(c);}bool BufferedImageSource::isConsumer(const ::jxx::Ptr<ImageConsumer>&c){return std::find(consumers_.begin(),consumers_.end(),c)!=consumers_.end();}void BufferedImageSource::removeConsumer(const ::jxx::Ptr<ImageConsumer>&c){consumers_.erase(std::remove(consumers_.begin(),consumers_.end(),c),consumers_.end());}void BufferedImageSource::startProduction(const ::jxx::Ptr<ImageConsumer>&c){if(!c||!image_)return;addConsumer(c);int w=image_->getWidth(nullptr),h=image_->getHeight(nullptr);auto pixels=::jxx::NEW<::jxx::lang::JxxArray<::jxx::lang::jint,1>>(static_cast<std::uint32_t>(w*h));for(int y=0;y<h;++y)for(int x=0;x<w;++x)(*pixels)[y*w+x]=image_->getRGB(x,y);c->setDimensions(w,h);c->setColorModel(ColorModel::getRGBdefault());c->setHints(ImageConsumer::TOPDOWNLEFTRIGHT|ImageConsumer::COMPLETESCANLINES|ImageConsumer::SINGLEPASS);c->setPixels(0,0,w,h,ColorModel::getRGBdefault(),pixels,0,w);c->imageComplete(ImageConsumer::STATICIMAGEDONE);}}
